      "content": "that's a pretty intense way to put it. i definitely need the economic stuff, but i know the reps are gonna bring up the environmental benefits and why these rules are being made in the first place. what's their side look like? i want to make sure i'm not caught off guard when they start talking about climate change or whatever.",
